Z||000006||ChadMan||08-11-2000||08:55 AM||||Congratulations, fieroshop.  Your GT just might be the classiest-looking Fiero I've ever seen.  It has an upmarket Euro look but still retains the Fiero heritage!  The color, the wheels, and the fastback make me think "Aston Martin."  <P>Compare the top photo with this one:<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/db7vcfr1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000007||Robert||08-11-2000||07:06 PM||||Hey Dan;<P>My side scoops came from PISA Corp. <BR>602-376-1550<BR>I just got off the line with Brian there, and he says they still <BR>sell the Mecham Style Scoop for about $225.00.  They are made on<BR>demand, and take about 3 weeks to get to you.<P>Their webpage is <A HREF="http://www.cybercars.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.cybercars.com</A> <P>Hope this helps<P>Later<BR>Robert<BR>||||reg||1
